<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan arrests South African on heroin charge.</title>
<headline>Pakistan arrests South African on heroin charge.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani customs authorities said on Tuesday they had arrested a South African national for trying to smuggle out 3.2 kg (seven pounds) of heroin concealed in amplifiers.</p>
<p>An official statement said the South African was arrested on Monday after customs staff seized heroin-filled amplifiers booked on an unspecified airline for Lome, capital of Togo.</p>
